    "result_text": "The change is complete and the build is green. Here's a summary of what I implemented.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec required that `POST /api/owners` accept an optional ISO `birthDate` and that the owner returned by `GET /api/owners/{id}` expose a derived `ageBand` (`MINOR` <18, `ADULT` 18\u201364, `SENIOR` 65+), computed against the owner's `registrationDate`.\n\nSince the DTOs are generated from the OpenAPI spec and the model is JPA-persisted, I threaded the field through every layer:\n\n**API contract** \u2014 `src/main/resources/openapi.yml`\n- Added `birthDate` (ISO `date`) to the `OwnerFields` schema (request input).\n- Added `ageBand` (read-only string) to the `Owner` schema (response output), documenting the thresholds and that it's absent when no `birthDate` is supplied. Kept it a plain string to match the existing derived fields (`locality`, `contactPreference`) and to be compatible with a MapStruct expression.\n\n**Domain model** \u2014 `model/Owner.java`\n- Added a persisted `birthDate` (`@Column(name = \"birth_date\")`) with getter/setter.\n\n**Derivation** \u2014 `mapper/AgeBand.java` (new) + `mapper/OwnerMapper.java`\n- New `AgeBand.forOwner(owner)` helper computes `Period.between(birthDate, registrationDate).getYears()` and maps it to the band, returning `null` when `birthDate` is absent. Modeled on the existing `MembershipLevel` static helper so MapStruct doesn't treat it as an implicit mapping.\n- Wired it into `toOwnerDto` via a `@Mapping(... expression ...)`; `birthDate` auto-maps by name in both directions.\n\n**Persistence schema** \u2014 all four `db/*/schema.sql`\n- Added `birth_date DATE` to the `owners` table, placed **last** so the positional hsqldb seed inserts needed only a trailing `NULL` (h2/postgres/mysql seeds use explicit column lists and were unaffected). Updated the 10 hsqldb `data.sql` owner inserts accordingly.\n\n**Tests:** `./mvnw test` \u2192 BUILD SUCCESS, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` (the repo's only test class is `AcceptanceTest`, whose `coreDerivesAgeBand` \u2014 `birthDate` 1990-01-01 \u2192 `ADULT` \u2014 now passes).",
